text = "Need to know before starting level:
- Some sliding doors require multiple pressure plates.
- You can craft while possessing certain characters, and use those items/potions.
- Difference between weak and strong possession potion.
- (Optional) You can use objects like boulders to weigh down pressure plates.


New:
Possession Potion

Step 1:
- Use given possession potion to get possession postion recipe.
- Use crafted possession potion to get speed potion recipe.
- Use possession potion to get third person to craft speed potion and use it to access the area with the button used to open the exit path.
- You CAN skip the steps to get the recipes if you already know the recipes and that is fine.
- You CAN save/load to respawn the plants to cheese the puzzle"
